#: 01-evernight.qml:18
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Evernight Vista New User Guide"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:19
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Evernight Vista! The following tools can help you get started "
"quickly and enhance your system experience."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:46
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Driver Manager"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:52
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Starting the driver manager can be used to install some proprietary drivers. "
"The Evernight Vista kernel can recognize most hardware drivers, and these "
"drivers can work automatically without installing extra drivers, but some "
"drivers need proprietary ones to work properly or to get better performance."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:59 01-evernight.qml:102 01-evernight.qml:145
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:89
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Update System"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:95
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Yumex can provide security updates, feature updates, and kernel updates for "
"the Evernight Vista operating system, helping to maintain its security, "
"boost performance, and add support for new hardware."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:132
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:138
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Open the KDE system settings, and you can set up your Evernight Vista "
"operating system your way, like configuring peripherals and appearance."
msgstr ""

